  [[https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-dispatcher/blob/main/spec/dispatcher.md#4-records-and-state §4 state]]
  [[https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-dispatcher/blob/main/spec/dispatcher.md#12-session-host-backend-later-activation-gate §12 SH2+]] / §14 gates
endlegend
